// IntroString :
"P2033158779" "Hey, {HeroName}, ready to get to work? Good, because I've got some for you. I just heard that there's a party in a warehouse over in Brickstown, and it's being attacked! Apparently the Carnival decided to crash the party, and the Malta Group showed up to contain the situation. I doubt either group cares much about the survival of the guests. But I do. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you rescue those party guests from the Carnival and the Malta Group?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3055842690" "Rescue the party guests from the Carnival and the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P3589287132" "The party's being thrown by a wealthy young socialite named Vanessa DeVore. She'd make a sweet interview."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4272678199" "Defeat all villains at party"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1193663316" "Those people at that party need your help!"

