// Dialog :
"P3468015546" "Look, {HeroName}, Vanessa DeVore sent you a thank you note! Ain't that nice? She says: <br><br>'It was quite noble of you to rescue my guests and myself. I suppose I could have done it myself, but then I would not have had the pleasure of seeing you in action. I have wanted to meet face to face for some time; you see, it is strange at the heart of the Carnival. I am never alone, but I am often lonely.' <br><br>Do you realize what this means? Vanessa DeVore is the Carnival's leader. When the Malta Group invaded her party, she posed as one of the victims to escape!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1581794480" "I hear {HeroName} came face to face with the Carnival's leader."

