"P2934456349" "Carnival drugs"
// DetailString :
"P933247426" "The Carnival planned to introduce this vast assortment of designer drugs to the city's water supply. It is likely that is amount of drugs would have sent many Paragon citizens on a week-long bender. It might have even sent some of them to the hospital."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P647705359" "One of my sources just called in with a hot lead; several Carnival minions were just seen dragging some large, heavy barrels into the sewers. The journalist in me likes the sound of that, but the humanitarian doesn't. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, I need you to get to the sewers and find out what the Carnival is up to.</A> You only have 1 hour to deal with the Carnival plot."
// AcceptString :
"P995131996" "Go to the sewers and find out what the Carnival is up to"
// SendOffString :
"P3512616357" "Take this camera. You never know when you'll need one."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1478895725" "Defeat all carnies in sewer"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P246676966" "The Carnival is up to something bad in the sewers. Trust an old newsman's instincts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2856403194" "A liberal dose of air freshener does nothing to mitigate the sewer's stink."

