// Dialog :
"P3148059428" "It's a good thing you were there to stop them, {HeroName}! It's hard to say what effect those Carnival drugs would have had on people. We might have just gone a little crazy and started living it up Carnival-style. But there's a good chance that some people would have had bad reactions; after all, those designer drugs are dangerous stuff."
// RandomFameString :
"P2245628197" "{HeroName}'s tough on drugs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1347600275" "The Carnival managed to get some of their party drugs into the water system. Fortunately, I was able to get word out pretty quickly, and the mayor is having bottled water brought in by the truckload. It'll take a good chunk out of the city's emergency budget, but it's worth it if it keeps our people safe."
// RandomFameString :
"P3225750480" "I hear it'll be a few more days before the city water is drinkable again."

