// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - RANDOM_MALE_BUSINESS 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2515179479" "There's no time to waste on this one. Mark Grier, the well-known philanthropist, has been abducted from his home in Founders' Falls. Nobody on his staff could remember anything about the kidnapping, which leads me to believe that the culprits are none other than our old friends, the Carnival of Shadows. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue Mark Grier from the Carnival.</A> You only have 90 minutes to rescue him."
// AcceptString :
"P1813544615" "Rescue Mark Grier from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P1863416178" "Grier made his fortune in the dot-com boom, then retired. Since the Rikti War, he's been incredibly generous with that fortune; several grammar schools and hospitals are still standing thanks to his donations."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3825321370" "Save Mark Grier from Carnival"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1000522299" "I need you to find Mark Grier at once!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P275289028" "A giggle echoes from the darkness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Mark 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1633399845" "Mark Grier"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2702089907" "Hello. Thank you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1747241506" "You rescued Mark Grier from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1526237952" "You failed to rescue Mark Grier in time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2294840229" "I just got word from the Grier household. You're not going to believe this, {HeroName}, but Mark Grier just died! He made out a new will, leaving all his money to Vanessa DeVore. Then, without a word, he simply expired. I have a theory. Remember how the Soulless Strongmen don't seem to be alive, though they can move and fight just like the carnies? I think that's what happened to Mark Grier. I think the Carnival sucked out his soul, then continued to animate his body long enough to make him sign over his fortune."
// RandomFameString :
"P405740380" "Did you hear about that philanthropist, Mark Grier? {HeroName} tried to save him, but he died anyway."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1559190270" "Mark Grier came home this afternoon. Don't get too excited, {HeroName}; it's not a happy ending. He made out a new will, leaving all his money to Vanessa DeVore. Then, without a word, he simply expired. I have a theory. Remember how the Soulless Strongmen don't seem to be alive, though they can move and fight just like the carnies? I think that's what happened to Mark Grier. I think the Carnival sucked out his soul, then continued to animate his body long enough to make him sign over his fortune."
// RandomFameString :
"P1919643140" "Mark Grier just died. It's really a shame; he gave a lot to this city."

