// Clue Name :
"P3757485600" "The researcher's story"
// DetailString :
"P4188782116" "One of the Midnight Squad researchers you rescued told you: <br><br>'By consuming our souls, they can also consume all our knowledge! My comrades and I know virtually all there is to know about the various villains that plague Paragon City. We also know a good bit about the heroes! Most Midnight Squad members learn to shield our thoughts from psychic invasion. But if the Carnival had sucked out our souls, all that information would be theirs!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2443704919" "Boy, am I glad you're available. Something terrible has happened! Several members of the Midnight Squad have been kidnapped by the Carnival of Shadows! My sources have a good lead on the kidnappers' whereabouts. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now I just need you to go in there and rescue those researchers.</A> You only have 75 minutes to deal with the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P3372348319" "Rescue the researchers"
// SendOffString :
"P4060706982" "The Midnight Squad has had trouble with the Carnival before. I'd move quickly if I were you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P538569051" "Defeat kidnapper & her crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P217663207" "I need you to wrap up that situation, {HeroName}. Bring those researchers home."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P299899355" "Very few Midnight Squad members make their occupations public knowledge. But all secrets seem to fall within the Carnival's domain."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
