"P3619945283" "We don't really know what happened to those Midnight Squad members, but we have to assume the worst. Some of the Squad's remaining members have a theory about the kidnappings. You see, most Midnight Squad members have learned to shield their thoughts. But there's a chance that the Carnival could get at their knowledge anyway, by consuming their souls. If that's the case, we'll have to be doubly on our guard from now on."
