// Clue Name :
"P1498507921" "Brass urn"
// DetailString :
"P1721962719" "When you touch this urn, you can feel the presence of a soul named Ramiro Garza. It seems he was murdered at a ritzy party."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ArtifactD 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P22802109" "Emerald necklace"
// DetailString :
"P3785708" "Each gem in this necklace seems to contain a human soul. They reach out to you, and it is all you can do not to slip the necklace around your throat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3633025497" "The number of deaths by carnie have been increasing lately. I've had a few reporters scrounging for tips, and I think I've hit on something. It seems there's a Carnival hideout that's been a hotbed of activity over the last few days. It could be a clue to their next big plot. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you could check it out for me, I'd sure appreciate it.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3648080473" "Check out the Carnival hideout"
// SendOffString :
"P3276424080" "I keep printing that Vanessa DeVore feeds on the souls of the Carnival's victims. Why doesn't anyone take me seriously?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2421205120" "Defeat Ring Mistress & her crew"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2645061982" "I need to know more about what's going on in that Carnival hideout."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1311181926" "Splashes of cheery pink paint do little to brighten this shabby warehouse."

