"P1298006398" "So, the Carnival was storing souls to deliver to Vanessa. Pretty scary, {HeroName}. If Vanessa is trying to increase her power, it can only mean that the Carnival has big plans for the future. I'll get these artifacts over to MAGI; maybe they can figure out a way to release the souls trapped within them."
// RandomFameString :
"P149448096" "I saw {HeroName} running around with a bunch of priceless trinkets. I wonder what they were for?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Amulet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P411700178" "Amulet"
// DetailString :
"P3141109358" "This gold amulet is embedded with a coral cameo. At first glance, the silhouette on the cameo appears quite lovely. But when you examine it more closely, you see that the young woman's mouth is dripping blood."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AmuletGlow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3726803569" "Glowing amulet"
// DetailString :
"P338233420" "When you defeated Mistress Josephine, the amulet Vanessa sent you started to glow. When you hold it before you, the face on the cameo whispers, 'Josephine.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4080717569" "You just got another letter from Vanessa DeVore. She sure seems to have taken a shine to you. It says: <br><br>'Don't you think it's time we met again, my dear {HeroName}? If you would like to see me, you have only to bring the enclosed amulet to the address below. When the amulet glows warmly in your hand, you will know that you have found me.' <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>I don't know if we can trust Vanessa, {HeroName}, but are you willing to check this out?</A> It could be that we'll learn something valuable. Or it could be that Vanessa's just trying to play us. I gotta warn you: I get the feeling that this could wind up a failure."
// AcceptString :
"P3854377850" "Check out Vanessa's invitation"
// SendOffString :
"P3961940222" "Be on your guard, {HeroName}. I wouldn't trust Vanessa any farther than I can throw her. And you know I've got a bad back."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2807627967" "Defeat all carnies in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3080919171" "I'd like you to check out that invitation from Vanessa DeVore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1675187373" "A voice asks querulously, 'And just what is Vanessa's plan?'"

