// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2169117246" "Here's the amulet. Kind of pretty, until you get a close look."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3591925192" "You defeated all the carnies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1754233001" "Mistress Josephine escaped!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3232212715" "You got another note from Vanessa. It says: <br><br>'Thank you for exposing the traitor within my midst. I had sensed that one of my inner circle had found a way to hide her thoughts, but I could not uncover her identity. An so I enlisted your help. The amulet had to be carried by someone pure of heart, you see. Kisses,<br>'V' <br><br>{HeroName}, I'm sorry. At least Mistress Josephine isn't at Vanessa's mercy. There was simply no way you could have known."
// RandomFameString :
"P1877286402" "Someone told me that Vanessa DeVore played {HeroName} for a fool!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3420083962" "You got another note from Vanessa. It says: <br><br>'Thank you for exposing the traitor within my midst. I had sensed that one of my inner circle had found a way to hide her thoughts, but I could not uncover her identity. An so I enlisted your help. The amulet had to be carried by someone pure of heart, you see. Kisses,<br>'V' <br><br>{HeroName}, I'm sorry. At least Mistress Josephine escaped, and isn't at Vanessa's mercy. There was simply no way you could have known."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Codex 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2446669037" "Da Vinci codex"
// DetailString :
"P1224925062" "As you page through this ancient manuscript, you're charmed by da Vinci's eloquent illustrations. A drawing of a harlequin mask catches your eye."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1482764362" "There was a break in last night at the Paragon City Museum. Only one thing was taken: a priceless da Vinci codex. The guards weren't harmed; they were found in their office, laughing it up while watching clips from the elevator security tapes. Who do we know who has a sick sense of humor and a penchant for old Italian artists? That's right, Vanessa DeVore. I'll bet you dollars to doughnuts she's got those paintings. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now someone has to get them back.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3882306253" "Get the paintings back from the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P2029431213" "I have to admit, I've always been a da Vinci fan. His journals are worth tens of millions these days; don't let this one slip away."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3643443465" "I promised the museum they'd have that codex back, good as new."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P614163777" "A stunning blue and green Matisse hangs on the wall. It looks as though this office has been fitted out as Vanessa DeVore's personal art gallery."

