// Objective - CodexInCrate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// Description :
"P3048249059" "Find the da Vinci codex"
// InteractBeginString :
"P504381428" "You begin to open the crate."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1981819548" "You have opened the crate."
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P914616070" "You found the da Vinci codex."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P322997830" "You defeated the Carnival and recovered the da Vinci codex."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3406181553" "Well, let's have a look at that codex. What's the matter, {HeroName}, surprised I speak Italian? Hey, I'm a Renaissance man. <br><br>Hmm, it looks like this passage describes a way to restore a soul from an inanimate object to its original body. Da Vinci was interested in just about everything, you know. I wonder whose soul the Carnival wants to restore? One of their victims? I've never known the carnies to show remorse for anything they've done."
// RandomFameString :
"P774803857" "Did you hear that {HeroName} rescued a da Vinci codex from the Carnival of Shadows?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2789402481" "{HeroName}, there's a situation going on over in the Kaufman Heights office park. It's Marauder's Praetorians, fighting the carnies! The whole scene is a mad house, and innocent people are in danger. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to get over there and stop that battle!</A> you only have 75 minutes to deal with the situation."
// AcceptString :
"P1937875235" "Stop the battle between the Carnival and Marauder's Praetorians"
// SendOffString :
"P3025086635" "I don't know what triggered this little feud, but we can't let innocent civilians pay the price! We've got an emergency force field in place to contain the battle. All you need to do is take the Light Rail over to Kaufman Heights and mop it up."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P112016790" "Defeat all feuding villains"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P972404314" "The violence is still raging over in Kaufman Heights!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P1303732605" "Kaufman Heights"
// EntryString :
"P3417502535" "You can't help but be shocked by the chaos. It looks as if this office park has been hit by a whirlwind."

