// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2329588233" "You stopped the battle between the Carnival and the Praetorians."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3044561828" "The Carnival and the Praetorians have done massive damage to this section of the city."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1815838873" "It sounds as though the Carnival exists on Praetorian Earth as well; but there, the carnies are the good guys. It's hard to believe, but it makes you wonder what Vanessa DeVore could have done with her gifts, if she'd chosen to use them for good. She's a powerful woman, {HeroName}. I'm sure she could have helped millions."
// RandomFameString :
"P4247862344" "So I went for a coffee run, and there they were! The Praetorians and the Carnival! I nearly fainted, but then I saw {HeroName}. And I knew it would be all right."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2328634148" "Well, the area was evacuated, but a lot of those buildings took heavy hits. I wouldn't be surprised if the whole area is declared off limits until some construction crews can get in there. From the eyewitness reports, it sounds as if the Carnival of Shadows exists on Praetorian Earth as well. But there, the carnies are the good guys. It's hard to believe, but it makes you wonder what Vanessa DeVore could have done with her gifts, if she'd chosen to use them for good. She's a powerful woman, {HeroName}. I'm sure she could have helped millions."
// RandomFameString :
"P1787362995" "My whole office park was torn to shreds. A lot of the businesses there probably won't recover."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3124219230" "Dominion Records' business plan"
// DetailString :
"P666320181" "This business plan details Vanessa's efforts to firmly control the music industry, by influencing the tastes of everyone within reach of her psychic powers. It is through these efforts that Dominion Records has grown so large in a short time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1880113347" "I'm chasing down a story, {HeroName}, and I could use your help. It seems that there's a new record company in town, Dominion Records, and it's grown to be a leader in the field overnight. Something about this doesn't seem right. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to sniff around their warehouse, see if you can find out if there's anything shady going on.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2228841847" "Investigate the record company"
// SendOffString :
"P3193734221" "I've learned to smell corruption from a mile away. Stick with me, kid, and you'll get a knack for it, too."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3295410402" "Defeat all villains in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2897423608" "I need to know more about Dominion Records."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P579325808" "The heavy bolts on the door tell you that Dominion Records values its privacy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3415033379" "When do we move the next batch?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1123872222" "As soon as the order comes in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2442621090" "Vanessa has those philistines eating out of her hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3473102023" "You know Vanessa. She says something is cool, and you believe her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1853959033" "You're a Nosey Parker!"

