"P800816299" "Uncertain citizen"
// Description :
"P170277626" "citizens to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P3709803079" "Save the last citizen!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3026007950" "You've got to know what happened here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2303622000" "Sorrowful citizen"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3325500907" "I can't stop crying!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3261455739" "Hysterical citizen"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P209532516" "They made me laugh so hard! I thought I was going to choke!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2813544213" "Regretful citizen"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3486596542" "I have so many regrets. Somehow, they brought them all to the surface!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2369893566" "Angry citizen"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3952914014" "I guess I'm really angry at my parents. I don't know how, but they made all this rage bubble over inside me! I feel awful!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P78283242" "Terrified citizen"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P944010666" "I have never been more frightened!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2498288452" "You rescued the citizens from the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P248782923" "{HeroName}, you've made an old newsman speechless. The Carnival was violating those people's minds, as part of a contest? Some sort of weird scavenger hunt for emotions? I'm going to call in some favors and get some crisis counselors down to that neighborhood. I've never been more determined to see the Carnival go up in flames."
// RandomFameString :
"P2401490430" "Did you hear about what happened in Madison Place? All is can say is, thank heaven for {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GhostStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2741590797" "The ghost's story"
// DetailString :
"P3434764942" "When you rescued the ghost of Brian Holloway, he told you: <br><br>'Those Carnival clowns thought they could command us to do their bidding, the same way they command the living. Well, I guess it might have worked, if you hadn't shown up. After all, we still have spirits. We are, in a sense, still alive. I have to tell you, it was nice to see the wide open sky again. It takes me back to my youth, driving the buggy back from a late barn dance, with my wife asleep against my shoulder.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3830186902" "I've been hearing some strange rumors about the Carnival mucking about in the old Shady Pines graveyard. I don't know how much can be credence we should give them; after all, people tend to see strange things when they get too close to Shady Pines. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>But I'd like you to check the situation out.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2730765367" "Check out the rumors about Carnival activity in the Shady Pines graveyard."
// SendOffString :
"P2770622267" "Shady Pines hasn't been in active use for years, and everything's gone a little to seed. But there's still a Light Rail stop nearby. I'm calling for an emergency force field to keep the carnies from spreading chaos elsewhere."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P161003946" "Rescue Carnival's victims"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P68109557" "I need to know what's happening in that graveyard!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P3060671583" "Shady Pines Graveyard"
// EntryString :
"P1523325436" "More than one person has told you that Shady Pines is an eerie place. You've never understood what all the fuss was about."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OUT_DOOR_LOC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2836360543" "These ghosts put up more of a fight than the live ones."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P37277936" "That's because they're more set in their ways."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1365167083" "Shopping for a tombstone?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OUT_DOOR_LOC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3194910843" "Can we really command the dead?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3225352058" "We command the living. What's the diff?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1415426280" "There's got to be an open grave around here somewhere."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - OUT_DOOR_LOC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3405962108" "Necromancy Nancy"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1616609021" "A soul is a soul, whether dead or alive. They will bend to our will."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3791218691" "You will spend eternity as my slave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Ghostie1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2936917600" "Ghost of Brian Holloway"
// Description :
"P1133144390" "ghosts to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1122120569" "Save the last ghost!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1286522287" "Let me tell you what these clowns have been up to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Ghostie2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P612185189" "Ghost of Millicent Todd"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3100565324" "Thank you, child. In my day, such rudeness simply wasn't tolerated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Ghostie3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P420227814" "Ghost of Ryan Worthington"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3645973886" "Those girlies thought they could command us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3967022135" "You prevented the Carnival of Shadows from commanding the spirits of the dead."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1527992002" "So, the Carnival was trying to control the spirits of the people buried in that graveyard? Pretty eerie. I wonder what would have happened if they had succeeded; from what we've seen of the Circle and the Tsoo, ghosts can be pretty powerful sometimes."
// RandomFameString :
"P654644393" "Last night I dreamed about my great-grandfather, Brian Holloway. He said that {HeroName} was truly {HeroAdjective}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2519808020" "No matter what I print, no one seems to take the Carnival seriously. People just keep going to their parties, getting portions of their souls siphoned off, and believing they had a great time! Someone's got to stop this, and I think you're the one to do it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>People have a lot of respect for you around here; if they see you in battle with the Carnival, they might get the message.</A> What do you say, {HeroName}? Want to set a good example?"
// AcceptString :
"P2189399611" "Do battle with the Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P647738609" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I really think this will do some good."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1522792282" "Combat Carnival menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2754205680" "I need you to defeat some more carnies."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4253483416" "I'm bored. Let's toast {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4276375218" "You have defeated enough carnies to make an impression on the civilians."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2097484294" "Good work, {HeroName}. People won't be so eager to go to a Carnival matinee after that sweep you made. The Carnival present themselves as a legitimate business; it's up to us to show people their true face."
// RandomFameString :
"P3948882393" "If {HeroName} hates the Carnival, then so do I!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2322133373" "The business owners in Peregrine Island have been complaining about a lot of Carnival thefts lately. Actually, they haven't been complaining so much as throwing up their hands and wondering who stole the cash register. Something has to be done. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to Peregrine Island and show the Carnival we won't put up with their hijinks. </A>Someone's got to make this city safe for small business."
// AcceptString :
"P514114129" "Go to Peregrine Island and show the Carnival you won't put up with their hijinks"
// SendOffString :
"P3193803907" "Vanessa DeVore never seems to get her grubby little fists on enough cash. If she had her way, everyone in town would owe her a tithe. You might want to start discouraging that attitude near Mera Heights or Nelson Borough."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2324889377" "Combat Carnival in Peregrine"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P369618656" "I'm still hearing reports of Carnival thefts over in Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3732228497" "Party pooper!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3543010666" "You have discouraged the Carnival from raiding the businesses of Peregrine Island."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2868007245" "I'm going to do an editorial on your sweep through Peregrine Island. Thanks to you, the business owners over there can hang on to their earnings, for a change."
// RandomFameString :
"P3727237022" "Did you hear that {HeroName} stopped a bunch of Carnival raids over in Peregrine Island?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Carnival_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Camera 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4048625000" "Harvey's old camera, 'Louise'"
// DetailString :
"P1163533327" "A peace sticker decorates the worn case of this twin lens reflex camera, which looks like it could easily be fifty years old."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Snapshots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1927712784" "Carnival snapshots"
// DetailString :
"P3787571489" "You took these photos while you were battling the Carnival in Peregrine Island. There's one in particular that might make a good front page: a carnie leans in close to the camera, sticking her tongue out. Behind her concealing mask, you can see her lovely green eyes narrowed in contempt."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4203380544" "My front page is looking a little light for tomorrow, {HeroName}, and I was wondering if you'd do me a big favor. I've been wanting to do a story on the Carnival activity over in Peregrine Island. They've been harassing people as usual, then making their victims forget what happened. If people are ever to understand the Carnival's depravity, they need to see these things with their own eyes. Trouble is, most of my photographers don't want to get near the Carnival, and I can't say that I blame them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Care to do a guest article for the Tattler?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3110144108" "Do a guest article for the Tattler"
// SendOffString :
"P2771148108" "I can just see it, in bold block letters. 'The Carnival: Through {HeroName}'s Eyes!' If I were you, I'd start near Mera Heights or Poseidon Square."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3482891054" "It's not so easy being a journalist, is it? Well, you'll get the hang of it. Back to the streets!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P698692262" "Make sure you get my good side!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P125115822" "Here's my old camera, Louise. Take good care of her; she may not be as pretty as she used to be, but she knows how to get the job done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1402088786" "You have enough material for an article on the Carnival of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2184941845" "Not too bad, not too bad. Kid, you may have journalist in you after all. These photos should show people the carnies as they truly are. Now, about the byline: do you want to be '{HeroName}' or just 'anonymous hero?'"
// RandomFameString :
"P1465954387" "Did you see the latest Tattler? {HeroName} had a guest column!"
